    sectorEmphasis: "The sector mix in Milton Keynes shapes how we prioritise services. For logistics and distribution companies, often based around Bletchley or Wolverton, corporation tax planning and capital allowances on warehouse fit outs and fleet vehicles are a regular focus. Tech and ecommerce businesses in Central Milton Keynes frequently come to us for R&D tax credit preparation, particularly those developing software platforms or automation systems. Financial services firms, including contractors and consultancies serving Santander UK or Volkswagen Financial Services, need specialist IR35 advice and payroll compliance. The automotive supply chain, supporting Red Bull Racing and nearby manufacturers, generates work on VAT partial exemption and international trading. Across all sectors, we handle exit planning for business owners who have grown their companies in the city and are considering a sale or succession. Our approach is to match the local tempo: direct, commercial, and without unnecessary complexity.",
