    sectorEmphasis: "Tonbridge's sector mix means we see recurring work patterns. Professional services firms in the Town Centre often need help with partnership tax structures and VAT on cross-border consultancy. Construction companies in Hildenborough and beyond regularly come to us for CIS returns, capital allowances on plant and machinery, and payroll for site staff. A Tonbridge School supplier, for example, might need help with VAT on educational supplies or corporation tax planning on a multi-year contract. Tech businesses in Higham Wood and the Castle area frequently claim R&D credits for software development or engineering improvements. EDF Energy's regional contractors often require complex payroll and IR35 reviews for off-payroll workers. Retailers in the Town Centre face margin pressure and benefit from our work on stock relief, property allowances, and exit planning. We tailor our service emphasis to these local realities rather than applying a generic template.",
