      body: "Take a Reigate insurance broker of about eight people applying the insurance exemption across its commercial lines, on the assumption that every commission stream is exempt. Reading the commission structures on 14 policies separates true intermediation from the administration, claims handling and risk management services sold alongside it, which are standard-rated. Suppose the policy files show \u00a3196,800 of income was consideration for those standard-rated services. At the VAT fraction of one sixth, that is \u00a332,800 of output tax underdeclared on these facts. The exemption falling away has a mirror effect: overheads previously treated as attributable to exempt supplies become partly recoverable, which reduces the net cost of the correction. Underpaid VAT can be spread under a time to pay arrangement.",
